She is hilarious.

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:38.258
You know that "Friends" episode
where Ross got the monkey?

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:39.926
-Yeah.

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:43.530
-Ruth's seen that.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.532
-We...

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:49.002
Are we -- are we going to
get to these tips?

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:50.036
We're not going to
get these tips, are we?

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:52.037
-Oh, Joan, Joan,
tell him your skit.

00:02:52.037 --> 00:02:54.340
-Oh, yeah, Joan, tell him.
Tell him your skit.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.441
Tell him your skit idea, Joan.

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:56.776
-I'm sure he doesn't
want to hear it.

00:02:56.776 --> 00:02:57.977
