00:03:06.785 --> 00:03:09.389
The cart -- Get this.

00:03:09.389 --> 00:03:13.058
The carts were on
the other side of the store.

00:03:13.058 --> 00:03:14.594
-What? Sorry. I missed it.

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:16.495
Carts were on
the other side of the store?

00:03:16.495 --> 00:03:19.999
-[ Laughing ] The carts were on
the other side of the store.

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:22.035
-Oh. And that's it?

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:24.603
-I mean, you'd obviously
have to add the jokes,

00:03:24.603 --> 00:03:26.472
